[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12551.75, "timestamp": "03:29:11", "text": "你为什么要欺负我？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12559.19, "timestamp": "03:29:19", "text": "我不会说你蠢。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12561.67, "timestamp": "03:29:21", "text": "我到底要跟你说多少遍？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12564.229, "timestamp": "03:29:24", "text": "我说“笨蛋”的时候，并不是指……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12567.19, "timestamp": "03:29:27", "text": "笨蛋，你知道的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12569.75, "timestamp": "03:29:29", "text": "别管“笨蛋”这个词的日语意思了。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12571.51, "timestamp": "03:29:31", "text": "我的上帝。你知道吗？我将停止使用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12573.99, "timestamp": "03:29:33", "text": "笨蛋。美好的。好吧，行。我会停止"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12579.51, "timestamp": "03:29:39", "text": "好吧，那就这样吧。我将停止使用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12581.75, "timestamp": "03:29:41", "text": "巴尔卡从现在起完全彻底"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12588.15, "timestamp": "03:29:48", "text": "是的，这造成了误会。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12591.269, "timestamp": "03:29:51", "text": "我不想那样。我不喜欢这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12595.429, "timestamp": "03:29:55", "text": "是的，我必须停止使用baka。"}]